From 02a9b8f2fb5a992367cbd2df61bf6a36cb6e630c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 17:20:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 120/140] feat: add Audiobook library and playback features

- Implement AudiobookLibraryViewModel for managing audiobook imports, removals, and updates.
- Create AudiobookPlayback for handling playback logic, including progress saving, seeking, and playback controls.
- Introduce AudiobookPlayerControls for user interface interactions, including playback controls, bookmarks, and chapters.
- Add support for sleep timer and playback speed adjustments.
- Integrate error handling and user feedback for audiobook operations.
